WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.400
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.670 --> 01:38.990
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.470 --> 01:41.800
[Episode 26]

4
01:42.810 --> 01:46.300
[Nanhuai Military General Staff Department]

5
01:47.200 --> 01:48.070
Tong Chunhai.

6
01:48.840 --> 01:49.600
Who told you

7
01:49.630 --> 01:51.039
about the whereabouts of Fifth Young Master Yu's wife?

8
01:51.039 --> 01:53.440
If you have the guts, put me out of my misery!

9
01:53.650 --> 01:55.580
Use whatever other tricks you have

10
01:56.340 --> 01:58.229
and entertain me!

11
02:01.640 --> 02:02.350
Do you really think

12
02:02.350 --> 02:03.550
I can't deal with you?

13
02:05.310 --> 02:07.240
You don't care about your own life.

14
02:08.000 --> 02:08.870
But what about the lives

15
02:08.870 --> 02:10.530
of the rest of the Tong family?

16
02:23.340 --> 02:25.270
Think carefully before you speak.

17
02:38.370 --> 02:40.340
Yu Changxuan, oh, Yu Changxuan.

18
02:41.650 --> 02:43.310
I can't believe you don't know

19
02:43.810 --> 02:45.870
that the sharpest blade in this world

20
02:46.060 --> 02:48.329
is a woman's jealousy.

21
04:00.590 --> 04:01.430
You're here.

22
04:03.430 --> 04:05.690
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

23
04:05.930 --> 04:07.790
When did you start smoking opium?

24
04:31.220 --> 04:32.330
Do you know?

25
04:33.510 --> 04:35.270
These long nights

26
04:35.540 --> 04:36.930
are bitterly cold.

27
04:37.720 --> 04:39.450
I stay awake to the night watch,

28
04:41.040 --> 04:42.370
listening to the wind.

29
04:43.659 --> 04:45.060
But time

30
04:46.630 --> 04:47.950
passes so slowly.

31
04:51.010 --> 04:53.190
So slowly it drives me crazy.

32
04:55.100 --> 04:55.950
Fortunately,

33
04:57.060 --> 04:58.220
with opium,

34
04:59.450 --> 05:02.950
all the worries, pain,

35
05:05.770 --> 05:06.600
and waiting

36
05:09.500 --> 05:10.510
are gone.

37
05:14.220 --> 05:15.500
Tong Chunhai told me

38
05:17.620 --> 05:18.420
that you only traded with him

39
05:18.420 --> 05:19.680
because of opium.

40
05:21.510 --> 05:22.310
I know

41
05:24.120 --> 05:25.220
you had no choice.

42
05:25.750 --> 05:26.560
No choice?

43
05:30.500 --> 05:31.390
Did you think

44
05:31.810 --> 05:33.620
this was just a transaction?

45
05:36.500 --> 05:38.480
When Tong Chunhai found me,

46
05:39.810 --> 05:42.100
I was indeed already addicted to opium.

47
05:43.010 --> 05:44.690
But cooperating with him

48
05:46.600 --> 05:47.659
was an opportunity

49
05:48.920 --> 05:50.420
to make Ye Pingjun

50
05:50.420 --> 05:52.120
disappear forever.

51
05:59.450 --> 06:00.950
Why did you do that?

52
06:06.890 --> 06:07.720
Why?

53
06:09.190 --> 06:11.120
Because as long as she's around...

54
06:11.430 --> 06:12.760
As long as she's around,

55
06:12.870 --> 06:15.200
you would never come to hear me sing again!

56
06:16.040 --> 06:16.880
You would never treat me

57
06:16.880 --> 06:18.240
as a confidante again.

58
06:19.100 --> 06:19.630
You would never

59
06:19.630 --> 06:20.770
tell me over and over again

60
06:20.770 --> 06:22.370
to live well!

61
06:24.810 --> 06:25.930
Without her,

62
06:27.000 --> 06:29.260
we'll become each other's only support.

63
06:44.600 --> 06:45.570
Did you know

64
06:47.800 --> 06:49.600
that after Pingjun was rescued,

65
06:50.810 --> 06:53.210
the first person she worried about was you?

66
06:54.740 --> 06:57.200
She was worried that you were also in danger.

67
06:59.810 --> 07:01.370
That silly girl.

68
07:05.800 --> 07:06.600
Perhaps

69
07:08.190 --> 07:09.860
you shouldn't have saved me.

70
07:12.500 --> 07:13.870
Perhaps at that time,

71
07:16.830 --> 07:18.430
I should have died.

72
07:21.480 --> 07:22.870
What's done is done.

73
07:25.070 --> 07:26.130
I don't regret it.

74
07:32.060 --> 07:33.310
Kill me.

75
08:11.740 --> 08:12.630
Shoot.

76
08:15.560 --> 08:17.190
What I owe Ye Pingjun,

77
08:20.430 --> 08:21.890
I'll pay back with my life.

78
08:46.600 --> 08:47.980
Why?

79
08:59.230 --> 08:59.890
Lan Qing.

80
09:01.840 --> 09:03.000
Look carefully.

81
09:04.970 --> 09:05.500
I

82
09:07.440 --> 09:08.330
am not him.

83
09:15.870 --> 09:17.340
This play ended long ago.

84
09:21.000 --> 09:22.270
You need to wake up.

85
10:11.370 --> 10:12.340
Don't move!

86
10:12.370 --> 10:12.950
Stand up!

87
10:13.650 --> 10:14.050
Get up!

88
10:14.230 --> 10:14.530
Get up!

89
10:14.530 --> 10:15.190
Don't move!

90
10:15.700 --> 10:16.790
Take the things away.

91
10:16.790 --> 10:17.250
Get out.

92
10:17.740 --> 10:18.340
And you.

93
10:18.550 --> 10:19.290
[Yu]

94
10:19.290 --> 10:20.100
Ever since my father took over

95
10:20.100 --> 10:21.220
Nanhuai,

96
10:21.770 --> 10:23.510
the whole city has strictly banned opium.

97
10:23.510 --> 10:24.250
[Yu]

98
10:24.250 --> 10:25.000
Now,

99
10:25.720 --> 10:26.250
various

100
10:26.250 --> 10:27.460
illegal opium dens have sprung up

101
10:27.460 --> 10:28.660
all over Nanhuai too.

102
10:29.340 --> 10:30.800
Our soldiers and officers

103
10:31.500 --> 10:32.720
are also frequent guests.

104
10:32.720 --> 10:33.580
-Hurry. -Move.

105
10:33.790 --> 10:34.590
I believe that

106
10:35.010 --> 10:36.200
in the Yu Army,

107
10:36.700 --> 10:40.080
there are High-ranking officials secretly covering for them.

108
10:40.080 --> 10:41.480
For every opium lamp lit,

109
10:41.930 --> 10:43.390
another person is ruined.

110
10:43.530 --> 10:44.910
For every box of opium sold,

111
10:44.910 --> 10:45.370
[Yu]

112
10:45.370 --> 10:46.770
another family is forced

113
10:47.150 --> 10:48.480
to sell their children.

114
10:49.870 --> 10:51.130
From this day forward,

115
10:51.530 --> 10:53.730
we will draw elites from all battalions

116
10:53.750 --> 10:55.210
to form an inspection team

117
10:55.340 --> 10:57.600
and completely shut down all opium dens.

118
10:57.750 --> 10:59.950
Any officer caught covering up for them

119
11:00.240 --> 11:01.700
will be shot immediately.

120
11:08.190 --> 11:16.190
[Dekangshun Western Pharmacy]

121
11:18.690 --> 11:18.750
[Dekangshun Western Pharmacy]

122
11:18.750 --> 11:20.050
My car is parked just ahead.

123
11:20.050 --> 11:21.080
Let me give you a ride.

124
11:21.080 --> 11:23.440
No need. I'll just call a rickshaw.

125
11:24.530 --> 11:25.860
Then I'll wait with you.

126
11:37.770 --> 11:38.930
[Dekangshun Western Pharmacy]

127
11:54.640 --> 11:56.570
[Dekangshun Western Pharmacy]

128
11:57.480 --> 11:58.540
What are you doing?

129
12:00.240 --> 12:01.100
Kuang Bingwen!

130
12:01.250 --> 12:02.110
Kuang Bingwen!

131
12:05.240 --> 12:06.000
Kuang Bingwen!

132
12:06.000 --> 12:07.000
Stop hitting him!

133
12:07.100 --> 12:07.770
Stop!

134
12:08.050 --> 12:08.770
Stop!

135
12:17.890 --> 12:18.750
Kuang Bingwen!

136
12:19.390 --> 12:20.380
Stop the car!

137
12:21.620 --> 12:22.350
Stop the car!

138
12:39.660 --> 12:40.650
Yu Jinxuan.

139
12:41.480 --> 12:42.480
For so many years,

140
12:43.740 --> 12:45.920
I've treated you like a goddess.

141
12:46.370 --> 12:47.380
I've never said anything

142
12:47.380 --> 12:48.380
you'd dislike,

143
12:48.860 --> 12:49.770
nor have I done anything

144
12:49.770 --> 12:50.740
you'd disapprove of.

145
12:50.740 --> 12:51.940
Yet, all these years,

146
12:52.870 --> 12:55.000
you’ve never once looked at me properly.

147
12:55.000 --> 12:57.600
You've always treated me as if I were invisible.

148
12:57.600 --> 12:59.050
And you blatantly mourn

149
12:59.070 --> 13:00.430
that dead man.

150
13:00.580 --> 13:01.780
Now,

151
13:02.550 --> 13:04.520
any random man

152
13:04.600 --> 13:05.670
can be so intimate

153
13:05.670 --> 13:07.070
with you?

154
13:17.290 --> 13:18.150
Kuang Bingwen.

155
13:19.080 --> 13:20.370
I will hate you.

156
13:20.370 --> 13:22.240
You never wanted to marry me,

157
13:22.360 --> 13:23.670
so you've hated me ever since

158
13:23.670 --> 13:24.930
the day we got married.

159
13:24.980 --> 13:26.320
Since that's the case,

160
13:26.500 --> 13:29.060
I might as well let you hate me to the end.

161
14:16.200 --> 14:17.170
Don't forget,

162
14:18.720 --> 14:19.790
you are mine.

163
14:20.670 --> 14:21.670
You're my wife.

164
14:22.630 --> 14:23.630
This fact

165
14:24.750 --> 14:26.290
will never change.

166
14:29.010 --> 14:30.240
Kuang Bingwen.

167
14:32.290 --> 14:33.960
Sooner or later,

168
14:35.790 --> 14:37.870
I will make you regret this.

169
14:42.840 --> 14:44.320
Then I'll wait and see

170
14:45.250 --> 14:46.790
how you make me regret it.

171
15:14.150 --> 15:14.810
Let me do it.

172
15:15.340 --> 15:16.410
Go get some rest.

173
15:17.150 --> 15:18.010
Let me do it.

174
15:18.720 --> 15:20.820
It takes a hundred days to recover from a bone injury.

175
15:20.820 --> 15:22.620
You haven't rested long enough.

176
15:30.270 --> 15:31.220
Thank you

177
15:32.720 --> 15:34.450
for agreeing to go back with me.

178
15:46.860 --> 15:47.670
Don't worry.

179
15:49.150 --> 15:51.660
My Mom and my sisters at home

180
15:52.000 --> 15:53.930
are all very easy to get along with.

181
15:54.620 --> 15:56.150
If you run into any trouble,

182
15:56.220 --> 15:57.150
just tell me.

183
15:57.750 --> 15:58.770
As a husband,

184
16:00.080 --> 16:01.820
I should have my wife's back.

185
16:05.580 --> 16:06.840
Even though right now,

186
16:07.510 --> 16:09.170
I'm only your husband in name.

187
16:14.360 --> 16:16.050
I will be a good wife.

188
16:21.460 --> 16:22.250
By the way.

189
16:23.570 --> 16:24.600
Can I take Xiaotang

190
16:24.600 --> 16:25.650
back with me?

191
16:26.620 --> 16:27.420
It's up to you.

192
16:28.120 --> 16:30.320
Do whatever you want.

193
16:43.820 --> 16:44.880
There is something

194
16:46.080 --> 16:47.410
I think you should know.

195
16:50.130 --> 16:52.060
Regarding Tong Chunhai's matter,

196
16:53.150 --> 16:54.680
Lan Qing was also involved.

197
16:55.670 --> 16:56.750
Lan Qing?

198
16:59.630 --> 17:00.490
Why did she...

199
17:00.580 --> 17:01.380
Because of me.

200
17:04.010 --> 17:04.849
You?

201
17:06.270 --> 17:07.440
To be exact,

202
17:08.510 --> 17:09.839
it wasn't because of me.

203
17:13.609 --> 17:14.640
Ten years ago,

204
17:16.310 --> 17:18.040
Lan Qing wasn't like she is now.

205
17:19.920 --> 17:20.720
She wasn't yet

206
17:20.740 --> 17:22.240
a famous star in Nanhuai.

207
17:26.000 --> 17:30.330
Great!

208
17:32.130 --> 17:33.200
Look at that poise.

209
17:33.220 --> 17:34.630
No wonder she's the star.

210
17:34.660 --> 17:35.270
Yeah.

211
17:39.810 --> 17:40.670
Let me tell you,

212
17:40.850 --> 17:43.050
I will definitely make it in the future.

213
17:47.520 --> 17:48.940
That was also when she met

214
17:49.180 --> 17:51.630
my brother, Yu Mingxuan.

215
17:59.130 --> 18:00.830
I won't hurt you.

216
18:05.540 --> 18:06.230
Get lost.

217
18:08.160 --> 18:09.050
Just you wait!

218
18:13.510 --> 18:14.910
Thank you, Young Master.

219
18:15.920 --> 18:17.010
We have met before.

220
18:17.660 --> 18:18.660
What's your name?

221
18:19.550 --> 18:20.750
I don't have a name.

222
18:21.460 --> 18:23.460
The troupe leader calls me Qing'er.

223
18:24.960 --> 18:25.750
Qing'er.

224
18:48.240 --> 18:52.880
Great!

225
18:53.070 --> 18:55.640
Zhang Chang, the Mayor of Jingzhao in the Han Dynasty,

226
18:55.640 --> 18:58.040
often painted his wife's eyebrows for her.

227
18:58.720 --> 19:01.160
He said the pleasures of the boudoir

228
19:02.420 --> 19:04.080
go beyond painting eyebrows.

229
19:07.350 --> 19:09.750
You look like you stepped out of a painting.

230
19:11.830 --> 19:15.050
[Mingxuan]

231
19:16.170 --> 19:17.530
Mingxuan?

232
19:25.170 --> 19:28.320
[Mingxuan, Lan Qing]

233
19:31.920 --> 19:32.810
Lan Qing.

234
19:44.510 --> 19:45.310
"Lan"

235
19:46.010 --> 19:47.420
is for the noble orchid,

236
19:48.270 --> 19:50.980
and "Qing" means a beautiful lady.

237
19:53.350 --> 19:55.070
Lan Qing.

238
19:57.220 --> 19:58.420
It sounds beautiful.

239
20:01.200 --> 20:03.090
I like the name you gave me.

240
20:04.250 --> 20:05.570
From now on,

241
20:06.270 --> 20:07.880
I am someone with a name too.

242
20:12.270 --> 20:13.510
Mingxuan.

243
20:14.850 --> 20:16.160
Lan Qing.

244
20:17.180 --> 20:22.980
[Mingxuan, Lan Qing]

245
20:36.750 --> 20:37.880
Please take

246
20:38.610 --> 20:39.870
good care of yourself.

247
20:41.810 --> 20:42.750
Have a safe trip.

248
20:44.550 --> 20:45.350
I'm leaving.

249
21:09.050 --> 21:10.110
So,

250
21:12.160 --> 21:14.620
she has been waiting for Mingxuan to return.

251
21:17.790 --> 21:19.590
Mingxuan was gone for 3 years.

252
21:22.270 --> 21:24.810
Later, Father pretended to be seriously ill

253
21:26.500 --> 21:28.500
and sent a telegram to call him back.

254
21:30.720 --> 21:32.850
He returned to Nanhuai only to find out

255
21:33.050 --> 21:34.270
it was a trick.

256
21:37.050 --> 21:38.110
I'm sorry, Father.

257
21:38.510 --> 21:39.710
I can't agree to this.

258
21:40.090 --> 21:41.020
I promised Lan Qing

259
21:41.020 --> 21:42.280
that I would marry her.

260
21:42.310 --> 21:43.710
I can't break my promise.

261
21:44.380 --> 21:45.180
Absurd.

262
21:46.070 --> 21:47.900
A son of mine

263
21:49.310 --> 21:50.110
marrying

264
21:50.110 --> 21:51.640
a lowly opera singer?

265
21:52.220 --> 21:52.810
To me,

266
21:52.810 --> 21:55.050
there is no distinction between noble and lowly.

267
21:55.050 --> 21:57.050
Besides, with Lan Qing's

268
21:57.050 --> 21:59.050
talent and resilience,

269
21:59.680 --> 22:00.740
she is much nobler

270
22:01.290 --> 22:03.020
than many of those who only have

271
22:03.420 --> 22:05.080
an empty aristocratic title.

272
22:05.660 --> 22:07.990
I sent you abroad to further your studies,

273
22:08.110 --> 22:10.160
and all you learned was sophistry.

274
22:10.810 --> 22:12.920
Do you want this opera singer

275
22:12.920 --> 22:15.250
to disappear without a trace?

276
22:19.680 --> 22:20.420
Father.

277
22:21.310 --> 22:22.850
Why must you force me?

278
22:24.050 --> 22:25.050
Mingxuan,

279
22:27.070 --> 22:29.200
you've been obedient since childhood

280
22:29.310 --> 22:30.270
and never disobeyed me...

281
22:30.270 --> 22:31.200
So I can promise you

282
22:31.200 --> 22:32.110
anything,

283
22:33.220 --> 22:34.460
except marriage.

284
22:34.850 --> 22:35.850
If you want to see

285
22:35.850 --> 22:38.250
the people of Nanhuai shed rivers of blood,

286
22:38.420 --> 22:39.290
then go!

287
22:42.510 --> 22:44.880
The regime seeking to restore the monarchy

288
22:44.880 --> 22:47.880
is supporting the Wan Army in annexing Nanhuai.

289
22:48.270 --> 22:51.530
A hundred thousand troops are stationed outside the city.

290
22:51.720 --> 22:54.310
If the city falls, there'll be a bloodbath.

291
22:58.050 --> 22:59.910
Deputy Chief Jun’s older brother

292
22:59.980 --> 23:01.380
is the minister to the US.

293
23:02.510 --> 23:03.550
The Jun family controls

294
23:03.550 --> 23:06.010
the channel for purchasing arms from the US.

295
23:06.420 --> 23:08.350
If the Jun family exerts pressure,

296
23:08.740 --> 23:11.070
they can surely keep the Wan army in check.

297
23:12.960 --> 23:15.290
So, the marriage alliance is a condition?

298
23:19.960 --> 23:20.680
Mingxuan.

299
23:23.180 --> 23:25.310
You are the eldest son of the Yu family.

300
23:29.030 --> 23:29.960
I know

301
23:30.960 --> 23:32.960
you have feelings for that singer.

302
23:34.010 --> 23:35.810
But when weighing personal love

303
23:35.830 --> 23:37.530
against the people of a city

304
23:39.350 --> 23:41.480
and the survival of the family,

305
23:42.850 --> 23:44.110
how should you choose?

306
24:24.290 --> 24:25.000
Lan Qing.

307
24:27.010 --> 24:27.900
I'm sorry.

308
24:30.290 --> 24:31.830
I broke my promise

309
24:32.660 --> 24:34.120
and married someone else.

310
24:36.070 --> 24:37.930
I don't expect your forgiveness.

311
24:38.460 --> 24:39.700
But in my heart,

312
24:41.000 --> 24:43.330
be it the past,

313
24:44.480 --> 24:45.980
present, or future,

314
24:47.460 --> 24:48.850
it's only you.

315
25:24.220 --> 25:24.850
Mingxuan.

316
25:26.200 --> 25:27.330
Hearing you say that

317
25:28.010 --> 25:28.810
is enough.

318
25:31.050 --> 25:32.520
You traded your freedom

319
25:33.110 --> 25:35.110
for the lives of the Nanhuai people.

320
25:36.030 --> 25:37.360
You did the right thing,

321
25:38.140 --> 25:39.340
and you had no choice.

322
25:40.770 --> 25:41.720
I don't hate you.

323
25:43.460 --> 25:45.070
I only hate this world.

324
26:01.380 --> 26:02.200
Mingxuan told

325
26:02.200 --> 26:03.850
Minru everything.

326
26:05.270 --> 26:06.240
But she was

327
26:06.740 --> 26:08.870
still willing to marry for the family.

328
26:10.790 --> 26:12.090
Mingxuan and Lan Qing

329
26:13.180 --> 26:15.180
finally shared some peaceful days.

330
26:16.350 --> 26:18.610
Then, the Battle of Heishitan happened.

331
26:20.460 --> 26:22.660
Mingxuan was appointed during a crisis

332
26:23.010 --> 26:24.410
to join the battlefield.

333
26:27.830 --> 26:30.290
Everything came to an abrupt end after that.

334
26:34.110 --> 26:35.250
In the end,

335
26:38.960 --> 26:40.810
Mingxuan never came back.

336
26:43.750 --> 26:45.050
When the bad news came,

337
26:46.350 --> 26:47.090
Lan Qing was already

338
26:47.090 --> 26:48.420
three months pregnant.

339
26:49.660 --> 26:50.860
She was so devastated

340
26:51.900 --> 26:53.160
that she lost the baby.

341
26:55.000 --> 26:56.130
And because of that,

342
26:57.110 --> 26:59.170
she could never have children again.

343
27:01.640 --> 27:03.440
She lost her lover and her baby

344
27:04.920 --> 27:06.460
one after another.

345
27:07.850 --> 27:09.450
How incredibly cruel that is

346
27:11.420 --> 27:13.380
for a woman.

347
27:22.050 --> 27:23.380
During those two years,

348
27:24.710 --> 27:26.350
Lan Qing was devastated.

349
27:27.660 --> 27:29.520
Without Mingxuan's protection,

350
27:30.460 --> 27:32.660
she endured the cold scorn of the world.

351
27:35.110 --> 27:37.040
She couldn't even hold on anymore.

352
27:45.220 --> 27:46.030
Lan Qing!

353
28:12.680 --> 28:13.980
Mingxuan.

354
28:41.510 --> 28:42.610
So,

355
28:44.130 --> 28:45.590
Lan Qing treated you as

356
28:45.590 --> 28:47.050
her only support,

357
28:48.050 --> 28:49.070
even...

358
28:49.070 --> 28:50.680
Even as Mingxuan's shadow.

359
28:55.140 --> 28:56.880
Later, I bought Yuchun Theater

360
28:57.880 --> 28:59.480
so she could sing in peace

361
29:00.510 --> 29:02.110
and avoid public criticism.

362
29:04.010 --> 29:04.930
After that,

363
29:05.310 --> 29:06.790
I never heard her

364
29:07.550 --> 29:08.460
mention Mingxuan's name

365
29:08.460 --> 29:09.510
to anyone again.

366
29:11.110 --> 29:12.460
It was as if Mingxuan

367
29:13.880 --> 29:15.000
had never appeared

368
29:15.000 --> 29:16.110
in her world.

369
29:18.510 --> 29:19.810
Sometimes I wonder

370
29:22.160 --> 29:23.420
if she hates him...

371
29:27.010 --> 29:28.340
For no longer being able

372
29:31.180 --> 29:32.310
to keep his promise.

373
29:40.110 --> 29:43.850
At the end of hate is deep love.

374
29:45.510 --> 29:47.910
Lan Qing's reluctance to mention him again

375
29:49.310 --> 29:51.710
might just be that she doesn't want to admit

376
29:53.610 --> 29:54.670
that in this world,

377
29:56.350 --> 29:58.010
Yu Mingxuan no longer exists.

378
30:05.510 --> 30:07.710
But people always have to move forward.

379
30:11.680 --> 30:13.610
The most important thing right now

380
30:16.210 --> 30:17.940
is to help Lan Qing quit opium.

381
30:20.750 --> 30:22.160
How is she doing now?

382
30:24.480 --> 30:25.940
I've already sent a doctor

383
30:25.960 --> 30:27.420
to treat her in isolation.

384
30:28.510 --> 30:30.170
Master Jin and his men are also

385
30:30.440 --> 30:31.970
guarding her day and night.

386
30:39.460 --> 30:40.590
But she must

387
30:42.720 --> 30:44.750
get through this on her own.

388
30:58.840 --> 31:02.770
[Yu Mansion]

389
31:03.310 --> 31:04.710
Why aren't they here yet?

390
31:08.090 --> 31:09.030
Here they come.

391
31:11.780 --> 31:14.660
[Yu Mansion]

392
31:15.850 --> 31:16.380
Mom,

393
31:16.750 --> 31:18.880
I brought your daughter-in-law back.

394
31:19.400 --> 31:21.220
After waiting for so long,

395
31:21.220 --> 31:22.490
the two of you

396
31:22.510 --> 31:23.640
are finally back.

397
31:30.750 --> 31:31.480
Call her Mom.

398
31:35.880 --> 31:36.420
Mom.

399
31:38.500 --> 31:40.390
They say newlyweds

400
31:40.420 --> 31:41.610
are inseparable.

401
31:41.960 --> 31:43.660
Mom, look at this young couple.

402
31:43.660 --> 31:44.680
Isn't that exactly the case?

403
31:44.680 --> 31:45.900
Yes.

404
31:46.660 --> 31:47.510
Pingjun, meeting you today,

405
31:47.510 --> 31:48.910
I finally understand why

406
31:49.110 --> 31:50.940
Changxuan ignored others

407
31:51.050 --> 31:52.770
and only cared about you.

408
31:53.480 --> 31:54.510
Things in this world

409
31:54.510 --> 31:56.110
are really just like in the storybooks.

410
31:56.110 --> 31:57.480
I never would have thought that

411
31:57.480 --> 31:59.480
after all this time, Miss Pingjun,

412
31:59.480 --> 32:00.810
you would actually marry Changxuan

413
32:00.810 --> 32:02.470
and become my sister-in-law.

414
32:10.880 --> 32:13.720
From now on, this is your home.

415
32:14.510 --> 32:15.960
Whatever you want to eat,

416
32:15.960 --> 32:17.420
drink, or use...

417
32:17.480 --> 32:18.850
Whatever you need,

418
32:19.250 --> 32:20.180
just come to Mom.

419
32:21.660 --> 32:23.950
Then I'll be troubling you from now on, Mom.

420
32:23.950 --> 32:25.890
It'll be no trouble at all.

421
32:26.660 --> 32:28.110
As for the family members,

422
32:28.110 --> 32:29.920
except for Jinxuan, who has been busy

423
32:29.920 --> 32:31.720
at the orphanage lately,

424
32:31.750 --> 32:33.610
you've met the rest.

425
32:35.480 --> 32:37.220
Let me take you to see your father-in-law.

426
32:37.220 --> 32:38.620
Let's go see your father.

427
32:40.690 --> 32:42.720
[Yu Mansion]

428
32:42.720 --> 32:44.590
Welcome, Fifth Young Madam.

429
33:01.980 --> 33:03.040
Fifth Young Madam,

430
33:03.330 --> 33:06.220
please serve tea to your in-laws.

431
33:23.420 --> 33:24.070
Father,

432
33:24.920 --> 33:26.120
please have some tea.

433
33:45.880 --> 33:48.750
These two are a match made in heaven.

434
33:48.880 --> 33:51.480
Seeing them makes me happy.

435
33:52.010 --> 33:53.920
He chose her himself.

436
33:54.110 --> 33:56.240
He doesn't care if you're happy or not.

437
33:59.270 --> 34:00.110
Commander,

438
34:01.050 --> 34:04.250
your daughter-in-law is waiting for you to drink the tea.

439
34:04.250 --> 34:05.770
Only when you drink this tea

440
34:05.770 --> 34:07.970
will this joyous occasion be complete.

441
34:08.480 --> 34:09.510
Yes, Father.

442
34:10.070 --> 34:11.760
Pingjun was able to wake up this time

443
34:11.760 --> 34:13.340
and turn ill luck into good fortune.

444
34:13.340 --> 34:15.139
It was truly a blessing from God.

445
34:15.510 --> 34:18.510
This shows that Pingjun is a blessed person.

446
34:19.710 --> 34:20.880
That's right.

447
34:54.360 --> 34:55.150
Father.

448
34:56.320 --> 34:57.520
Please have some tea.

449
35:15.780 --> 35:16.570
Father.

450
35:17.820 --> 35:19.150
Please have some tea.

451
35:48.860 --> 35:51.480
From now on, you must remember

452
35:51.650 --> 35:53.110
the rules of the Yu family.

453
35:54.510 --> 35:57.440
Do not bring disgrace upon the Yu family’s standing.

454
36:00.280 --> 36:02.260
I understand, Father.

455
36:10.610 --> 36:11.670
Fifth Young Madam.

456
36:16.340 --> 36:17.050
Mom.

457
36:18.070 --> 36:19.270
Please have some tea.

458
36:31.510 --> 36:32.460
Pingjun.

459
36:34.210 --> 36:35.380
This bracelet

460
36:35.460 --> 36:37.820
was passed down to me by my mother-in-law.

461
36:40.420 --> 36:41.880
Jade can nourish a person.

462
36:42.150 --> 36:43.230
Wear it

463
36:43.840 --> 36:45.960
and slowly recover your health.

464
36:46.480 --> 36:49.260
I just hope you two will be safe

465
36:49.260 --> 36:50.820
and happy together.

466
36:51.260 --> 36:53.260
He won't listen to others.

467
36:53.360 --> 36:55.960
But he will definitely listen to you.

468
36:56.670 --> 36:58.880
I am entrusting him to you.

469
37:03.150 --> 37:04.130
On your feet now.

470
37:10.210 --> 37:11.150
All right.

471
37:11.320 --> 37:12.630
Mom, didn't you invite

472
37:12.630 --> 37:13.960
the Qingfeng Troupe

473
37:13.960 --> 37:15.030
to perform today?

474
37:15.210 --> 37:16.860
Isn't it time for the play to start?

475
37:16.860 --> 37:17.440
Father.

476
37:19.260 --> 37:20.230
Yes, Commander.

477
37:20.710 --> 37:22.610
It's great for the family to have some fun together.

478
37:22.610 --> 37:24.810
Wanxuan has been asking to watch a play.

479
37:26.010 --> 37:28.010
Is it Boss Xu Lingtong?

480
37:28.880 --> 37:31.360
Yes, we specially invited him for you.

481
37:32.510 --> 37:33.300
Let's go.

482
37:33.320 --> 37:34.110
Let's go.

483
37:35.380 --> 37:36.380
Let's go, Father.

484
37:37.820 --> 37:39.550
Hurry, let's go.

485
38:14.210 --> 38:17.280
Young Madam, everything is in order.

486
38:18.650 --> 38:19.920
Thank you for your hard work.

487
38:19.920 --> 38:22.030
Go and rest now.

488
38:22.320 --> 38:22.890
Yes.

489
38:47.860 --> 38:50.050
Why are you just standing there?

490
38:51.480 --> 38:52.650
I just came back from outside.

491
38:52.650 --> 38:54.250
The cold hasn't worn off yet.

492
38:54.510 --> 38:55.650
You're not wearing much.

493
38:55.650 --> 38:57.110
I'm afraid that if I come closer,

494
38:57.110 --> 38:58.010
you'll shiver.

495
39:06.050 --> 39:07.260
How

496
39:09.460 --> 39:10.920
will we sleep tonight?

497
39:17.010 --> 39:18.010
What do you think?

498
39:22.460 --> 39:23.670
I think...

499
39:25.010 --> 39:26.050
We could...

500
39:55.210 --> 39:56.190
Are you planning

501
39:57.230 --> 39:59.010
to sleep on the floor all night?

502
40:01.650 --> 40:03.910
Your injuries haven't fully healed yet.

503
40:04.010 --> 40:06.070
I can't let a wounded person like you

504
40:06.070 --> 40:07.460
sleep on the floor.

505
40:08.070 --> 40:09.130
It's cold at night.

506
40:09.920 --> 40:11.250
What if you catch a cold?

507
40:12.210 --> 40:15.210
I'm fine. I'm healthy and can handle the cold.

508
40:34.710 --> 40:35.770
What are you doing?

509
40:35.780 --> 40:36.940
Let go!

510
40:38.920 --> 40:39.980
What are you doing?

511
40:40.920 --> 40:41.710
Behave.

512
41:28.480 --> 41:29.320
Don't worry.

513
41:30.380 --> 41:31.590
This bed is big enough

514
41:32.320 --> 41:33.920
for two people.

515
41:34.760 --> 41:36.220
One blanket for each of us.

516
41:36.510 --> 41:37.970
Without your permission,

517
41:38.010 --> 41:38.650
I won't lay

518
41:38.650 --> 41:39.550
a finger on you.

519
42:34.960 --> 42:35.760
Pingjun.

520
42:38.460 --> 42:39.610
From now on at home,

521
42:41.400 --> 42:43.800
you don't have to humble yourself anymore.

522
42:45.400 --> 42:48.600
You don't have to walk on eggshells around others either.

523
42:50.000 --> 42:51.190
Just remember that

524
42:52.630 --> 42:53.900
no matter what,

525
42:56.650 --> 42:58.300
I'm always on your side.

526
43:14.640 --> 43:15.750
Thank you.

527
43:26.410 --> 43:30.580
[Marriage Certificate]

528
43:36.770 --> 43:42.430
[Name: Ye Pingjun] [Name: Yu Changxuan]

529
43:47.950 --> 43:50.080
[Marriage Certificate]

530
43:50.080 --> 43:52.590
[Groom: Yu Changxuan]

531
45:03.940 --> 45:06.730
[Marriage Certificate]

532
45:06.750 --> 45:10.130
[Groom: Yu Changxuan]

533
45:14.930 --> 45:18.370
[Groom: Yu Changxuan]

534
45:44.880 --> 45:45.670
Xiaotang.

535
45:52.510 --> 45:53.780
Everyone, be careful.

536
45:55.150 --> 45:56.300
Move the camellias a bit to the left.

537
45:56.300 --> 45:56.610
Alright.

538
45:56.610 --> 45:57.740
That's about right.

539
45:59.110 --> 46:01.320
Azaleas love the sun.

540
46:01.320 --> 46:02.170
Put them further forward.

541
46:02.170 --> 46:02.590
Okay.

542
46:02.640 --> 46:02.970
Here?

543
46:02.980 --> 46:03.640
That works.

544
46:03.920 --> 46:04.880
Young Madam!

545
46:05.510 --> 46:06.130
Look.

546
46:06.320 --> 46:07.780
Fifth Young Master Yu

547
46:07.840 --> 46:10.320
specifically ordered these flowers to be planted for you.

548
46:10.320 --> 46:11.650
Fifth Young Master Yu also said

549
46:11.650 --> 46:12.940
that in the future, this courtyard

550
46:12.940 --> 46:15.200
will be completely filled with flowers!

551
46:15.820 --> 46:17.820
Young Madam, when you see it by then,

552
46:17.820 --> 46:19.620
you'll definitely be very happy

553
46:19.710 --> 46:21.420
and feel bright and cheerful.

554
46:40.460 --> 46:42.170
I finally understand today

555
46:42.250 --> 46:43.680
that line from the opera,

556
46:43.710 --> 46:46.510
"Clouds long for her robes, and flowers yearn for her beauty."

557
46:46.510 --> 46:48.010
Young Madam, when you stand here,

558
46:48.010 --> 46:50.760
these flowers just become your backdrop.

559
46:51.920 --> 46:53.320
You and your sweet words.

560
46:53.510 --> 46:55.090
If Fifth Young Master Yu were here,

561
46:55.090 --> 46:56.950
he would definitely think so too.

562
47:18.050 --> 47:18.860
Looks like you put in

563
47:18.860 --> 47:19.960
quite a bit of effort bringing

564
47:19.960 --> 47:21.420
the bride home last night.

565
47:21.500 --> 47:22.630
You've worked hard.

566
47:23.290 --> 47:25.900
[Secretariat] [Dispatch Room]

567
47:25.900 --> 47:26.820
If you ask me,

568
47:26.960 --> 47:28.820
you've suffered a big loss.

569
47:29.710 --> 47:30.610
What loss?

570
47:31.000 --> 47:32.530
How is this not a loss?

571
47:32.690 --> 47:33.400
Think about it.

572
47:33.400 --> 47:34.010
You used to

573
47:34.070 --> 47:34.590
have the reputation

574
47:34.590 --> 47:35.760
of a playboy.

575
47:35.760 --> 47:36.530
Everyone thought

576
47:36.530 --> 47:37.360
you were always

577
47:37.360 --> 47:38.900
surrounded by beauty.

578
47:39.090 --> 47:39.950
But in reality?

579
47:40.190 --> 47:41.300
From beginning to end,

580
47:41.300 --> 47:43.380
your attention was fixed solely on Pingjun.

581
47:43.380 --> 47:45.050
That's such pure love.

582
47:48.000 --> 47:49.570
You should say these nice things

583
47:49.570 --> 47:51.300
in front of Pingjun more often.

584
47:51.730 --> 47:53.130
Look how pleased you are.

585
47:53.630 --> 47:54.060
Right.

586
47:54.120 --> 47:55.820
Let me tell you something serious.

587
47:55.820 --> 47:56.340
Later,

588
47:56.420 --> 47:57.630
I'll get you some good ointment.

589
47:57.630 --> 47:58.630
It works wonders.

590
47:58.780 --> 47:59.440
Just in case

591
47:59.630 --> 48:01.430
you have another round tonight.

592
48:01.460 --> 48:01.990
Li Boren!

593
48:02.030 --> 48:02.420
Here!

594
48:04.000 --> 48:05.460
Focus on serious matters.

595
48:05.460 --> 48:06.420
You scared me.

596
48:07.630 --> 48:07.940
My good sir,

597
48:07.940 --> 48:09.070
isn't this a serious matter?
